<p>Standard integration templates can be used to enable you to start from a template to save time and effort.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Target Deployment Platform </strong></p>
<p>SuccessFactors&nbsp;Integration Center : enables HR business analysts to build, deploy, and monitor <em>simple file-based outbound integrations</em>.</p>
<p><strong>About the Template</strong></p>
<p>This template is a predefined integration that can be run on the SFSF Integration Center. Standard Integration Templates helps you to start from a template to save time and effort.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Time and Attendance Template is a report or file showing each employees demographic data for a 3rd party time and attendance provider.&nbsp; If a file output is requested, the file is output as a comma delimited file type.</p>
<p><strong>How to consume this template</strong></p>
<p>Please download the integration definition files from the&nbsp;Artifacts tab below and upload them to&nbsp;SuccessFactors&nbsp;Integration Center.</p>
